ergo5_detected.description:
A copy of the ergo5 integration (`ergo5/hass-energa-my-meter-api`) was found on this system:

{names}
{paths}

It shares the same domain `energa_mobile` as this integration. Keeping both copies can cause conflicts and duplicate entities/statistics. It is recommended to remove the ergo5 copy; existing entities and long-term statistics are preserved. Detected source: {source}.

duplicate_domain_detected.description:
Extra folders declaring `domain: energa_mobile` were found in `custom_components`:

{paths}

The live integration is: {own_path}

Home Assistant loads every folder with this domain, so a backup/copy loads the domain twice and can hang startup or duplicate entities. Move the copies OUTSIDE `custom_components` (e.g. to a backup folder) or delete their `manifest.json`. The live integration's entities and statistics are preserved.
